      "markdown": "| Outdoor Temperature   | ≤4       | 4 ī 18   | ≥18     |\n|-----------------------|----------|----------|---------|\n| Heating ˄ Hz ˅        | 20 ī 110 | 20 ī 90  | 20 ī 53 |\n| Defrosting ˄ Hz ˅     | 80       | 80       | 80      |\n| Outdoor Temperature   | ≤23      | 23 ī 32  | ≥32     |\n| Cooling ˄ Hz ˅        | 20 ī 50  | 20 ī 70  | 20 ī 95 |"
