      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2131",
      "reading_order": 2805,
      "section": "Compressor Startup",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 119.6113166,
        "t": 493.64794659999995,
        "r": 551.6210243600011,
        "b": 432.40699353999986
      },
      "content": "Regardless of target frequency of indoor unit, each time when compressor is from off to on, it must maintain 60Hz,90Hz for one minute (Frequency will be immediately decreased under the condition that outdoor unit air discharge temperature overheating protection is activated or over current of compressor) then the compressor will operate towards target frequency. This process does not exist in normal operation of unit."
    },
    {
